  "notes": [
    "The Repeater now makes organic mouth-click clusters nearby and eight damp, sticky footstep contacts. Metallic percussion and the close growl layer are removed; its original blood-curdling chase recording is unchanged.",
    "A hunt starts with the correct scream from its beginning. Every hunter has a dedicated moving vocal channel, so a full effects pool or recent ambient call cannot swallow that onset. Screams finish through line-of-sight breaks and keep Blackwater hall echoes.",
    "Completing an objective makes every hunter scream. The host selects one reachable investigator by actual path distance, preferring a hunter free of a chase or committed attack; other hunters retain their normal behavior. Sight and noise can still naturally redirect the investigation.",
    "Objective reactions are synchronized across the co-op party. Duplicate and stale objective activations cannot replay the chorus; clients follow the host's investigator choice.",
    "Windows 10/11 x64. Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart. Everyone in a co-op group should update."
  ],
